## About this project's structure

This project contains two independent TypeScript codelines:
- **mocka** (mock-a/): Handles fare calculation logic, including age-based fare tier rules. Changes to src/fares.ts affect how prices are determined and applied.
- **mockb** (mock-b/): Handles schedule display logic, including rendering of stop lists and departure boards. Changes to src/schedule.ts affect what data is shown to users.

Each codeline is tested with vitest. When examining a change, first determine which codeline it belongs to, as they are independently deployed and their runtime boundaries do not overlap.

